        ("Food", "A sacrificed pet gives 51-100 points at Tier 0, 101-150 at Tier 1, 151-200 at Tier 2, 251-300 at Tier 3, 401-450 at Tier 4, 601-650 at Tier 5 and 851-900 at Tier 6.", GD, src("JTPets")),
