    ("Liquid Glass, Limestone Mass, Pristine Glass, Cromlech Bricks and Condensed Vortex at level 100, in that order.", G, src("ImeniaHG")),
    ("Hourglass level 2 (100b sand): upgrades open, tier-one upgrades complete.", G, src("PiwuHG", "ImeniaHG")),
    ("Hourglass level 3 (100Qa sand): Timeline open. Reset at once and spend the first 10 infinity on three upgrades.", G, src("ImeniaHG", "PiwuHG")),
