        ("Generator order", "Sandstone Sample, Glass Sample, Water Sample, Clay Block, Bit of Knowledge, Liquid Glass, Limestone Mass, Pristine Glass, Cromlech Bricks, Condensed Vortex, Sol Essence, Locked Orery, Golden Bit, Golden Scales, Golden Claw.", GD, src("PiwuHG")),
