    ("Pick order", "The numbers start from Piwu's talent guides for each class (August 2026, before Nightmare): class skills first, then attack, crit and attack speed. The role then moves a few nodes earlier or later.", G, src("PiwuWar", "PiwuRogue", "PiwuMage")),
