    ("Rare-drop farmer", "The character that opens boss chests and farms cards, where Drop Quantity does count (each point is +1% to the drop chance, and keys limit how many chests you open). Takes Magicfind as soon as the node before it is taken. This is the Drop Farmer of the Three Musketeers method.", G, src("Dawnk3", "MTRogue", "SteamDQ")),
    ("Leveller", "A character you want levelled fast to open new zones early: the Trailblazer. Takes Bonus XP as soon as it is reachable. Rogue has no Bonus XP nodes, so it plays as a Pusher.", G, src("Dawnk3", "PiwuRogue")),
    ("Role orders", "No guide publishes a numbered order for the three farmer roles. The trees apply the rules above to Piwu's order.", MR, ""),
